\f0\fs24 \cf0 Scripts and data frames are organized as following:\
Github -> network_stability_heatwaves: \
\
folder: dataframes\
Contains all data frames needed to run the scripts.\
1_source_data.xlsx: contains a summery of all empirical data used in the model, including their references\
\
folder: MixSIAR\
Contains the script and output of the MixSIAR model to analyze the stable isotope data.\
It's not needed to run the model, as the output is also summarized in the 1_source_data.xlsx\
\
folder: output\
Contains all model output data frames used to produce all results and figures.\
\
folder: scripts\
Contains the correct script order to execute all modeling steps, using data frames from the data frames folder. \
